			(property "Description" "Texas Instruments PCA9548A - I2C Multiplexer\n\nThe PCA9548A device has eight bidirectional translating switches that can be controlled through the I2C bus. The SCL/SDA upstream pair fans out to eight downstream pairs, or channels. Any individual SCn/SDn channel or combination of channels can be selected, determined by the contents of the programmable control register. These downstream channels can be used to resolve I2C slave address conflicts."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
				(hide yes)
